						"pointId": 5323
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							4911.33,
							445.408,
							4750.45
						],
						"pointId": 5576
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							4914.769,
							445.422,
							4751.097
						],
						"pointId": 5621
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740910501,
					"content": "Monsieur Aigouy, I... I'm back...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910502,
					"content": "You two... Looks like you saved Balent. Thank you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910503,
					"content": "Silly boy! I told you before that there's no need to work so hard at such a dangerous job. Just report it to Estienne during the scheduled check-in and have him find someone to deal with it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910504,
					"content": "I taught you out of the goodness of my heart, and what did you give me in return? You accused me of not taking work seriously and of neglecting my duties.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910505,
					"content": "And now look, just what did I say? It was too dangerous for you to deal with. You didn't believe me then, but hopefully, you've learned your lesson now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910506,
					"content": "I... I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910507,
					"content": "What, still don't want to admit you were wrong? I'd really like to hear just what other enlightened opinions you still have to offer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910508,
					"content": "I want to drink some water...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910509,
					"content": "Balent finds a water bottle and gulps down several mouthfuls, then breaks off a piece of dry bread and starts chewing.\\nThe whole time, he is completely focused on eating and drinking, seemingly deaf to the old man's words, regardless of what he says.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740910510,
					"content": "Whew... At least... At least I'm still alive. Thank you for your help, were it not for you two, I'm afraid I probably...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910511,
					"content": "...Probably would have left your parents with nothing but survivor benefits.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910512,
					"content": "Hmph! That would still be better than getting fired for causing a huge safety incident and getting fired because I was slacking on the job!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910513,
					"content": "You little... *sigh* Nothing I say ever gets through to you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Aigouy"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910514,
					"content": "Guys, this may sound a little shameless, but I've got to say it... This is for everybody's safety.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910515,
					"content": "I assume the two of you know how to dive, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910516,
					"content": "Yeah, but...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910517,
					"content": "When I was captured by the Hilichurls, I lost my divesuit. Our routine inspections revealed that the spares were defective, and though we've applied for new ones, they haven't been delivered yet...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910518,
					"content": "But, the maintenance of pipelines cannot be delayed. If the two of you know how to dive, then could you please go inspect the Fortress pipelines for me?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910519,
					"content": "Of course, you will be well compensated for your work, so don't worry about that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910520,
					"content": "Seeing as this involves everybody's safety, it's not like we can't do it. Inspecting pipelines sounds like a job that should be left to professionals, though. Are you sure about leaving it to us?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910521,
					"content": "It's nothing more than a routine checkup. I'm expecting there will be some minor problems, as there were four areas at risk for leaks the last time I did an inspection. They shouldn't be that difficult to fix, though. I'll explain it to you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910522
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910522,
					"content": "If you notice there's a <color=#00E1FFFF>gas leak</color> in the pipeline, then it was likely caused by an aquatic creature... or non-creature object colliding with it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910523,
					"content": "The emergency measure here is to <color=#00E1FFFF>control the flow by adjusting the regulator valve, temporarily stopping the gas leak</color>. That's all you need to do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910527,
					"content": "There's a technique for adjusting the regulator valve. <color=#00E1FFFF>When rotating the handwheel, you must keep an eye on the gas flow volume. If it is decreasing, then you are on the right track</color>.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910524,
					"content": "Oh... Paimon thinks she gets it now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910525
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910525,
					"content": "Should you have any questions about your job, I'll be happy to clarify them for you at any time before you complete the routine inspection.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740910526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Balent"
				},
				{
					"id": 740910526,
					"content": "Okay! Let's give it a shot!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7409110,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7409110
			],
